cuiatmDBhvzhGbicrs4xHcmEZCo5icTjazFj3rHnbUib5RdklFczaPA%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a37d9e0b&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9Feficr5ehHhr74sQ97wuLxZZw0vRSFuZWUho1pZFCiaPiaJwLWgJF4y5ibXVs2XcZ1u4ERqn3ms8pa9wib6tTGeryVMD5ic0t8Ev1Knoo%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=75f52214&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FeeiaoN4zibYGhKzXllkjdzUZ4KIdS4eHuz0iag0BcSJbJ4ibiaeoc6ibGcHohvk9qZPYzhic3zmzFyEaM2ibIF6oPAYhGwSZlXgEBwBuss%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=3c9bcb64&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9Fedcuk8BIfD0qz0PhQneia8WkmKF2Ju6mI4LMtVrE31A0omLHlwCBWs33J0OibtodA7ROv4ibfTN1Te06etem33tvxySWZlthkP1BY%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "ByteDance's Volcengine discusses prompt injection attacks on AI agents, classifying them as direct (user input) or indirect (embedded in external data). Unlike jailbreaks targeting model constraints, prompt injection hijacks application behavior by exploiting LLMs' inability to strictly separate instructions from data—a fundamental architectural limitation OpenAI considers a long-term challenge.\n\nVolcengine's AgentSentry implements four-layer defense: L1 input normalization (decoding hidden content), L2 source isolation (marking trusted vs. untrusted content), L3 hierarchical detection (rules plus fine-tuned models), and L4 output behavior control (risk-based action gating). The framework emphasizes depth over single-point solutions, as attackers continuously evolve bypass techniques."}, "settings": {}}